# Vercel builds only the Astro frontend (Root Directory = frontend/). Keep uploads lean by
# excluding the backend, the ~109 MB LFS database, and other non-frontend assets. (dist/ and
# node_modules/ are already gitignored, so Vercel rebuilds them; db/sggs.sqlite would upload only
# as an LFS pointer anyway — this is belt-and-suspenders for faster builds.)
db/
database.sqlite
webapp/
ios/
pipeline/
corpus/
concordance/
validation/
audit/
contract/
*.pdf
*.key
